  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|description": "A generator powers the whole building it reaches, not just a circle of tiles. Lights, fridges, stoves, televisions and washers come on across every floor, the roof and the basement, and the generator burns fuel for all of it. Two generators split the bill instead of doubling it, and a breaker trips if you overload one. Feed a generator from a barrel standing beside it, or from your whole base's gasoline with LG Extended Plumbing installed. Safe to add mid-save. To remove it, switch it off and restart once first. Singleplayer, hosted multiplayer and dedicated server.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|name": "LG Extended Electricity",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity": "Extended Electricity",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Breaker": "Circuit breaker",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_BreakerWattsPerPoint": "Breaker watts per quality point",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_BreakerWattsPerPoint_tooltip": "How much a generator can run at once. A better generator gets more: at 225 they range from 5400 to 8100 watts. Lower this for a harder game, raise it for an easier one.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Breaker_tooltip": "Put too much on a generator and its breaker trips, taking every generator on the same buildings with it. Start them all again, then right-click one and reset. To stop it tripping, add a generator or turn something off. Needs Generator Fuel Consumption above zero.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ChargeFuel": "Charge fuel for the extra rooms",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ChargeFuel_tooltip": "On: the extra rooms cost fuel, so a big building burns more. Off: they are free. To change the fuel rate itself, use the game's own Generator Fuel Consumption.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Debug": "Log power decisions",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Debug_tooltip": "Writes every power change to the log file. Only useful for tracking down a problem.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Enabled": "Enable extended electricity",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_Enabled_tooltip": "A generator powers the whole building it reaches, not just the tiles around it. Every floor, the roof and the basement. Turn this off and restart before removing the mod.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ExtendByDefault": "Wire up automatically",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ExtendByDefault_tooltip": "On: plug a generator in and it powers the building straight away. Off: you right-click it and pick Wire up the building first. Either way you can change your mind on any generator.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ExteriorReach": "Tiles powered outside the walls",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ExteriorReach_tooltip": "How far power reaches past the walls, so a porch light or an outdoor freezer works. Set 0 for indoors only. Some tiles reach a little further than this, so treat it as a minimum.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_FuelFromPumps": "Fuel lines from station pumps",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_FuelFromPumps_tooltip": "Lets you pipe a fuel station pump into a generator parked next to it, so it runs off the tanks below. Off: barrels only.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_FuelLine": "Fuel lines to generators",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_FuelLine_tooltip": "Lets you pipe petrol to a generator with a pipe wrench. A barrel next to it feeds it directly. With LG Extended Plumbing, a generator can also draw from the whole base's petrol barrels. Off: nothing can be connected.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_GeneratorRange": "Generator range",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_GeneratorRange_tooltip": "How many tiles a running generator powers around itself, and how far away a building can be to wire it up. Used when the mod sets generator range.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_GeneratorVerticalRange": "Generator levels",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_GeneratorVerticalRange_tooltip": "How many levels above and below a running generator it powers. Wired buildings always get every level. Used when the mod sets generator vertical range.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ShareLoad": "Generators share the load",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_ShareLoad_tooltip": "On: two generators on one building split the fuel bill instead of both paying it in full. Off: each one pays in full.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_StreetLightWatts": "Watts a wired street light uses",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_StreetLightWatts_tooltip": "What one street light costs your generator once you wire it up. The game charges nothing for street lights, so this figure is the mod's. Set 0 to make them free.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_TakeOverGeneratorRange": "Mod sets generator range",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_TakeOverGeneratorRange_tooltip": "On: generators and wire relays use the two ranges below, and the game's Generator tile range is set to 1. Off: the game's range is used. Needs a restart.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_TakeOverGeneratorVerticalRange": "Mod sets generator vertical range",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_TakeOverGeneratorVerticalRange_tooltip": "On: generators and wire relays use the two level settings below, and the game's Generator vertical range is set to 1. Only works while Mod sets generator range is on. Off: the game's vertical range is used. Needs a restart.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_WireRelayRange": "Wire relay range",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_WireRelayRange_tooltip": "How many tiles a wire relay powers around itself, and how many electrical wires it costs. Used when the mod sets generator range.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_WireRelayVerticalRange": "Wire relay levels",
  "translate_en|mods/LGExtendedElectricity/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGExtendedElectricity_WireRelayVerticalRange_tooltip": "How many levels above and below a wire relay it powers. Used when the mod sets generator vertical range.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGRealisticPowerUsage/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|description": "Appliances draw what they really draw. The game gives every appliance of a kind the same number, and it is the most it could ever draw rather than what it really uses - a fridge is billed 1300 watts around the clock when its compressor runs a few minutes an hour. Worse, a big appliance is billed once for every tile it covers, so one large store fridge costs 2600 watts. I rate every appliance once, at what it actually uses over time, and tell a mini fridge apart from a walk-in cooler. Needs LG Extended Electricity. Safe to add or remove mid-save. Singleplayer, hosted multiplayer and dedicated server.",
  "translate_en|mods/LGRealisticPowerUsage/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Mod.json|name": "LG Realistic Power Usage",
  "translate_en|mods/LGRealisticPowerUsage/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGRealisticPowerUsage": "Realistic Power Usage",
  "translate_en|mods/LGRealisticPowerUsage/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGRealisticPowerUsage_Increases": "Let things cost more too",
  "translate_en|mods/LGRealisticPowerUsage/42.20/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LGRealisticPowerUsage_Increases_tooltip": "Off: nothing ever uses more power than it did before, only less. On: a few things that really use a lot now cost a lot. A clothes dryer goes to 3000 watts and an oven to 1500."
}
